    wedgeIntegral_add_wedgeIntegral_dirichletExplicitFormulaIntegrand_eq_mul_sum_candidateContribution
      chi x z w hposition
  change Complex.wedgeIntegral z w F + Complex.wedgeIntegral w z F =
    (2 * Real.pi * I) * S at hboundary
